<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MAY 15.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MAY 15.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the main headlines reported by Eesti Raadio on Thursday at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and cannot vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Parliament exempted heating fuel from the value added tax and began discussing the customs tariff law.</p>
<p>- Music days in Tartu start on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
